@server = http://localhost:3000
@expenses = {{server}}/api/expenses

### Get all expenses
GET {{expenses}}

### Add a new expense
POST {{expenses}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2025-11-30T00:00:00Z",
  "description": "Team lunch 2",
  "payerId": 12,
  "amount": 25.55
}

### Reset expenses
POST {{expenses}}/reset

### Expenses where amount >= 30
GET {{expenses}}?amount=30

### Expenses where amount is invalid
GET {{expenses}}?amount=abc

